{"availability":"available","full":"Sa-ar/saar-to","name":"saar-to","description":"Personal URL shortener at saar.to — Next.js, MongoDB, invite-only accounts.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2020-05-30T15:34:49Z","updated":"2026-10-05T12:45:20Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://saar.to","topics":["mongodb","nextjs","url-shortener","vercel"],"demo":"https://saar.to/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.271Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.271Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.271Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.271Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A personal, invite-only URL shortener with click analytics — gold on deep violet-black.","Built with the Next.js App Router, MongoDB/Mongoose, NextAuth, TanStack (Query · Form · Table), and shadcn/ui.","saar.to is a small, opinionated URL shortener for a single owner and a handful of invited members. It is not an open, public sign-up product — access is invite-only. Every account manages its own links; the owner can see and edit everything. Short-link redirects themselves are public, so works for anyone."],"features":["Create saar.to/slug path links, or (for owners) premium slug.saar.to subdomain links.","Edit any link's destination, slug, and expiry after the fact.","Rich per-link analytics: click totals, last access, and a 14-day daily breakdown.","The app's own routes (/login, /api, /stats, …) can never be claimed as a slug.","Invite-only accounts — the owner is bootstrapped from the CLI; members join through a one-time invite link that expires in 7 days."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sa-ar/saar-to/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8b0556b1e76f32ee9bd5ba021c0d5b20689249608b9f74d7d3be6314c26c0aa5","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.535Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.535Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A p